---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ClinicalUpdates from '../components/ClinicalUpdates.astro';
import {whatsappBookingUrl} from '../data/clinic';
const bookingUrl = whatsappBookingUrl('/our-work/');
---
<Layout title="Clinical Updates & Treatment Cases | 32 Whites Dental" description="Explore 32 Whites’ published updates on repeat root canal treatment, composite bonding and instrument sterilisation, with links to original clinic posts." pageType="CollectionPage" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Clinical updates',path:'/our-work/'}]}>
  <div class="container"><section class="page-hero page-hero-wide"><span class="eyebrow">From the clinic · Published on Google</span><h1>A tooth worth reassessing.<br/><span class="soft-text">A gap worth discussing.</span></h1><p>See the clinic’s published updates on repeat root canal treatment, composite bonding for a front-tooth gap and instrument sterilisation. Each update links to its original Google post, so you can read the context behind the care.</p></section><section id="cases" aria-labelledby="cases-heading"><h2 id="cases-heading" class="sr-only">Published clinic updates</h2><ClinicalUpdates/></section><section class="section-sm article-content narrow"><h2>What could a case mean for your teeth?</h2><p>A published case describes one person’s circumstances. It cannot predict your result or replace an examination. Ask why a particular approach was selected, which alternatives were considered and what ongoing care is needed.</p><h2>The preparation you don’t see</h2><p>You can ask the clinic how instruments are prepared, which items are single use and how the team manages cleaning between appointments. The linked sterilisation update is the clinic’s own statement, rather than an independent certification.</p><p>These summaries link to the clinic’s original public posts. Patient photographs are not reproduced here. Dates identify those posts, not approval dates for this website’s clinical guides.</p><nav class="filter-links" aria-label="Related information"><a href="/services/root-canal-treatment/">Root canal information</a><a href="/services/smile-makeover/">Smile planning</a><a href="/doctors/dr-bhakti-ghanwat-gavade/">Meet your dentist</a><a href={bookingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="whatsapp_booking_click">Book on WhatsApp<Icon name="diagonal" size={14}/></a></nav></section></div>
</Layout>
